#: src/features/pnrr/components/filters/PnrrInfoSheet.tsx:187
msgid "The grant is the non-reimbursable part. The loan is the reimbursable part of the PNRR at Romania level. The \"loan\" label does not mean that each beneficiary took an individual credit."
msgstr "The grant is the non-reimbursable part. The loan is the reimbursable part of the PNRR at Romania level. The \"loan\" label does not mean that each beneficiary took an individual credit."

#: src/features/pnrr/components/filters/PnrrInfoSheet.tsx:45
msgid "The main figure \"Total PNRR allocation\" comes from the official aggregated indicator published by MIPE. It is the official plan budget, not the sum of project rows."
msgstr "The main figure \"Total PNRR allocation\" comes from the official aggregated indicator published by MIPE. It is the official plan budget, not the sum of project rows."

#: src/features/pnrr/components/filters/PnrrInfoSheet.tsx:256
msgid "The measure is the plan level under which projects are organized. A measure can include multiple projects, beneficiaries, milestones, and targets."
msgstr "The measure is the plan level under which projects are organized. A measure can include multiple projects, beneficiaries, milestones, and targets."

#: src/features/pnrr/components/tabs/PnrrOverview.tsx:240
msgid "The percentage shows the share of listed project value from the component in the displayed project value. It is not the official PNRR allocation. Click on a row to filter."
msgstr "The percentage shows the share of listed project value from the component in the displayed project value. It is not the official PNRR allocation. Click on a row to filter."

#: src/features/pnrr/components/tabs/PnrrOverview.tsx:252
msgid "The percentage shows the share of listed project value from the county in the displayed project value. National projects can distort local comparisons."
msgstr "The percentage shows the share of listed project value from the county in the displayed project value. National projects can distort local comparisons."

#: src/features/pnrr/components/filters/PnrrInfoSheet.tsx:87
msgid "The project has a published-data issue, such as possible duplicate rows or missing financial progress. It does not automatically indicate wrongdoing or zero payments."
msgstr "The project has a published-data issue, such as possible duplicate rows or missing financial progress. It does not automatically indicate wrongdoing or zero payments."

#: src/features/pnrr/components/filters/PnrrInfoSheet.tsx:73
msgid "The project matches at least one risk rule, such as high value with low progress, a financial-technical gap, or reported financial progress over 100%. It is a signal for verification, not a verdict."
msgstr "The project matches at least one risk rule, such as high value with low progress, a financial-technical gap, or reported financial progress over 100%. It is a signal for verification, not a verdict."

#: src/features/pnrr/components/filters/PnrrInfoSheet.tsx:296
msgid "The public / private or non-public classification is an operational rule of the dashboard. It helps analysis, but special cases may require manual verification."
msgstr "The public / private or non-public classification is an operational rule of the dashboard. It helps analysis, but special cases may require manual verification."

#: src/features/pnrr/components/filters/PnrrInfoSheet.tsx:52
msgid "The rest of the analyses use the official project list: projects grouped by id_angajament, official records at row level, and amounts listed separately from payments to beneficiaries."
msgstr "The rest of the analyses use the official project list: projects grouped by id_angajament, official records at row level, and amounts listed separately from payments to beneficiaries."

#: src/features/pnrr/lib/anomaly-definitions.ts:91
msgid "This filter highlights projects with large listed value and low reported technical progress. It is implementation pressure and requires verification in official documents."
msgstr "This filter highlights projects with large listed value and low reported technical progress. It is implementation pressure and requires verification in official documents."

#: src/features/pnrr/lib/anomaly-definitions.ts:114
msgid "This filter marks rows that appear to describe the same project, but have different information. It is a data interpretation issue, not proof of double funding."
msgstr "This filter marks rows that appear to describe the same project, but have different information. It is a data interpretation issue, not proof of double funding."

#: src/features/pnrr/lib/anomaly-definitions.ts:124
msgid "This filter shows large projects without published financial progress in the dataset. Missing data does not mean zero payments; it may indicate incomplete reporting or delayed updates."
msgstr "This filter shows large projects without published financial progress in the dataset. Missing data does not mean zero payments; it may indicate incomplete reporting or delayed updates."

#: src/features/pnrr/lib/anomaly-definitions.ts:134
msgid "This filter shows projects reported as technically completed and without published financial progress in the dataset. It is a data limitation that prevents comparison between delivery and financial execution."
msgstr "This filter shows projects reported as technically completed and without published financial progress in the dataset. It is a data limitation that prevents comparison between delivery and financial execution."

#: src/features/pnrr/lib/anomaly-definitions.ts:101
msgid "This filter shows projects reported as technically completed, but with reported financial progress under 80%. It does not claim that reimbursement is blocked or refused."
msgstr "This filter shows projects reported as technically completed, but with reported financial progress under 80%. It does not claim that reimbursement is blocked or refused."

#: src/features/pnrr/lib/anomaly-definitions.ts:71
msgid "This filter shows projects where reported financial progress exceeds 100%. It is a data anomaly that may come from adjustments, changes in reference value, delayed updates, or errors."
msgstr "This filter shows projects where reported financial progress exceeds 100%. It is a data anomaly that may come from adjustments, changes in reference value, delayed updates, or errors."

#: src/features/pnrr/lib/anomaly-definitions.ts:81
msgid "This filter shows projects where reported financial progress is well above reported technical progress. It may have legitimate explanations, including advances or delayed technical reporting."
msgstr "This filter shows projects where reported financial progress is well above reported technical progress. It may have legitimate explanations, including advances or delayed technical reporting."

#: src/features/pnrr/components/filters/PnrrInfoSheet.tsx:434
msgid "This is the fixed rate used by the PNRR dashboard model, not a daily BNR exchange rate."
msgstr "This is the fixed rate used by the PNRR dashboard model, not a daily BNR exchange rate."

